{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0549f8c63710c1843eaf0332132190b8078964dd6b4090497355a9ce2df2faf3", "ja": "（『りるきゃん』の次のグラビア撮影で、\n街中に来ている。今日は可憐ひとりだけど……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄下期《莉露甜心》的写真照，我们来到街上。\n虽然今天只有可怜一个人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "fb47e77418302809d70bd85a7ab90b5b9a72e18f5535750277447515cfb1fb84", "ja": "うぅ……なんだか、ひ、人に見られてるような……。\nき、緊張……します……。", "zh": "呜呜……总觉得一、一直有人在看我……\n好……好紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c2bf10e9accdc1b5d3af1d97610ce3b1fce2787bd4e013d5047fa44f9c50b916", "ja": "まぁ、可憐は立っているだけでも絵になるしな……。\nそれだけ、人目を惹きつけてるって事だよ。", "zh": "嗯，毕竟可怜光是站在那里就美得像幅画……\n这代表你非常引人注目啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "1c8892aca3c095cf62cee06787285b30fcaf5dd0bcf9a3b8affd61f22e0dca64", "ja": "そ、そうですか……？　翼ちゃんや茜ちゃんは、\nかわいくて、少女漫画の世界にピッタリですけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？小翼跟小茜她们很可爱，\n完全符合少女漫画的世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "d78e8b2f8a54408bf17978846f69f360c14e0a552fddb9e864256edcde7868bd", "ja": "わ、私じゃ……『りるきゃん』のイメージに、\n合わないんじゃないかって……ふ、不安です……。", "zh": "但是我、我很担心……\n自己会不会跟《莉露甜心》的形象不符……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "23fb595e52b2d42b1f165db9634e3782ff85324a6561288ccd5c0dc9ab808114", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。可憐の可愛さだって、\n『りるきゃん』の読者に、十分伝わってると思う。", "zh": "没这回事，我想《莉露甜心》的读者，\n应该都能充分感受到可怜的可爱之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "1deef57a91bc2e0646e5f3c08b7246fa3e434f56603e432086c38e5d09fdb745", "ja": "ほ、本当……ですか……？", "zh": "你、你说的是……真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0025388562773694ad90c43d9c2bd7ab74e007f79c6fa4b521c3e6303910c800", "ja": "ああ。SNSに上げた写真にも、\nたくさんコメントが付いてるじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯，上传到SNS的照片，\n不也有很多读者在底下留言吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "8acaa9c6c9657b2d925caf116fc89389ce5360aee6da02131e5055bb37ef1778", "ja": "そ、そうなんですね……。こ、怖くて……まだ、\nちゃんとコメント、見られてませんでした……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样……我、我因为太害怕……\n都没有仔细看留言……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3d94333cbfa71faad98ed9538e285663404b8d2a270dc14c215185050e9191a9", "ja": "確かに、「可愛い」よりは「綺麗」ってコメントが\n多いかもしれないけど……でも、それでいいと思う。", "zh": "虽然比起「可爱」，称赞你「漂亮」的留言比较多……\n不过，我觉得这样也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4346f48425f268656209f3ab3a3a8ec179112cbfaf92dac9e995403f8b4166f1", "ja": "『りるきゃん』の読者にだって、可憐や茜、翼が\n違うように、いろんなタイプの子がいるはずなんだ。", "zh": "就像可怜、茜跟翼各有不同一样，\n《莉露甜心》的读者，一定也有相当多类型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "c2cab7063dc00b62d89de76278dd6e141823ad0c5b72f1afeae1c83a1b4dc897", "ja": "あ……。そ、そう……ですね……。\nいろんな子がいるはず……ですよね……。", "zh": "啊……说、说得……也是……\n读者中一定也有……各式各样的人才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c62a85cf5bb447a52312e3f886b26b006c7b1613ece03c39052cc6a6e6326f82", "ja": "それに、可憐の魅力が綺麗なだけじゃないって事は、\nちゃんと伝わると思う。", "zh": "而且，我相信他们一定能感受到，\n可怜的魅力不只是漂亮而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e7a5f893dc1c08db25134b041484b1460f0ea57c5f658bba7192d2d9aededa88", "ja": "その衣装だって、よく似合ってるしな！\nだから……。", "zh": "毕竟那套服装穿起来相当适合你啊！\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "96dfc8e2231db888f3fcd23b0c14b518ff7a3f6d8bea6cfc4079c74f5c43aca4", "ja": "あ、あの……！　わ、わかりましたから、\n{$P$}さん……もう、その辺で……。", "zh": "那、那个……！我已经了、了解了，所以\n{$P$}先生……拜托说到这里就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "fd90f9188f62bd0c91b9df8074a9047959e067ff74e8576b68ce95b6f51b5bda", "ja": "そんなに、き、綺麗って言われると、私……\nか、顔が、熱くなってきちゃいますから……。", "zh": "因为你一直夸我漂、漂亮……\n我的脸都要烧、烧起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "99a97e689c117caa4e76814dc6277219739af96dbb5b8f3770cb150be4c0cfc8", "ja": "ん、そうか？　でも、本当にそう思ってるからな！\n可憐には自信を持って仕事をしてほしい。", "zh": "咦，是吗？不过，我是真心这么想的！\n我希望可怜能够带着自信面对工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "4926554d3d57fc57344fb9779d4921147f0f32b0f5fc466369809bbcb7a9af69", "ja": "は、はい……ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "好、好的……谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "002dfadaec1cd4985ea32b22bbf7dc0b4fe05eaf386b27e81840da85b392b18e", "ja": "あの……お仕事、がんばりますから……\nひ、ひとつだけ、お願いしてもいいですか……？", "zh": "那个……我会努力工作，所以……\n可、可以请你帮我一个忙吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7977c5ea648a48aa26266f8c8cf9c49063ee0828ce12be3a1f9d93420d9eb2c1", "ja": "お願い？　なんだ？", "zh": "帮忙？是什么忙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "e9c673768f0bdea890089a5bea66dcd18be40627d93167caa3c6493bd0c286c5", "ja": "こ、今度、洋服選びに付き合ってもらっても……\nい、いいですか……？", "zh": "请、请问你下次……\n可不可以陪我去选、选衣服……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "854f3c403870bec5b988f3b67cab0e8c1e415b30eba26d441427ebdae2d6f0f6", "ja": "この間は、翼ちゃんと茜ちゃんに見てもらって……\nす……すごく、参考になったので……。", "zh": "前阵子请小翼跟小茜陪我一起挑选的时候……\n我……我真的受到很多启发……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "cf13920d26c07c3ef5eefa56edf772ebe83b8ec58cfc37325956998d7e0f3db9", "ja": "次は{$P$}さんに……\nに、似合うかどうか、見てもらえたらって……。", "zh": "所以下次我希望能请{$P$}先生……\n帮我看看衣服适不适合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1023_p", "source_sha256": "91f190ad90861b58b48fdd420618ba247140bcd0fb219328ef271a32b24b1829", "ja": "それくらい、いつでも構わないぞ。せっかくだし、\nこの撮影が終わったら、帰りに見ていくか？", "zh": "这点小事的话，我随时可以奉陪。\n既然都提了，等这场拍摄结束，要不要在回程时去逛逛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "87a6160ac59968e0c1e108e5ad7e941f214edc313f811393ca4c1dc5af0a8878", "ja": "は、はい……！\nありがとうございます……！", "zh": "好、好的……！\n谢谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0103_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "ece6063329f20e447f0bcf9ad38caa8e5adf3d4cdc270d9469b890a5d6b31881", "ja": "わ、私……このあとの撮影、がんばれそうです……\nてへへ……♪", "zh": "我、我觉得……更有动力迎接之后的拍摄了……\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
